---
import '../../../styles.css';
const api=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_API_URL||'https://api.artstudionala.com';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Editor produk · Nala</title></head><body class="admin-shell editor-shell" data-api={api} data-editor="plan"><header class="site-header"><div class="wrap header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/admin/"><img src="/nala-logo.png" alt="Artstudio Nala"><span><strong>Operasional</strong><small>Member Nala</small></span></a><nav class="nav"><a class="button" href="/admin/">← Produk</a><button id="logout">Keluar</button></nav></div></header><main class="wrap member-layout"><p id="notice" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="state" class="card">Memuat editor…</p><section id="editor" class="hidden"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/admin/">Admin</a><span>›</span><span>Produk</span></nav><form id="editor-form" class="card editor-form"><span class="eyebrow">Produk</span><h1 id="editor-title"></h1><p class="muted">Perubahan paket berlaku untuk checkout berikutnya. Hak dan snapshot pesanan lama tidak berubah.</p><label class="field">Nama<input name="name" minlength="2" maxlength="100" required></label><div class="form-grid"><label class="field">Harga (IDR)<input name="price" type="number" min="1" max="1000000000" required></label><label class="field">Durasi hari<input name="durationDays" type="number" min="1" max="730" required></label></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="field">Status<select name="status"><option value="active">Aktif</option><option value="archived">Arsip</option></select><small id="new-active-note" class="muted hidden">Produk baru selalu dibuat aktif. Arsipkan setelah tersimpan bila diperlukan.</small></label><label class="field">Jenis akses<select name="accessMode"><option value="selected">Kursus terpilih</option><option value="legacy_all">Legacy · seluruh katalog</option></select></label></div><fieldset id="course-field"><legend>Kursus dalam paket</legend><p class="muted">Kursus draft dapat dipilih, tetapi pembeli belum dapat membukanya sampai diterbitkan.</p><div id="course-options" class="course-options"></div></fieldset><div class="form-actions"><a class="button" href="/admin/">Batal</a><button class="primary">Simpan produk</button></div></form></section></main><script is:inline src="/admin-editor.js"></script></body></html>